  "name": "卡維",
  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">天穹之鏡 · 卡維</span></p><p>體悟、仁愛與識美之知。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/06/06/125391187/115807e57a8e6af6408e25c134e79efb_3794241959891701160.png",
